#, php-format
msgid "This site keeps the following display settings in the browser (local storage), only when the visitor chooses them: %s. They serve only to remember these choices and are erased by clearing this site's data in the browser."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: list of services
#: src/Consent.php:533
#, php-format
msgid "This site uses the following non-essential services only if you accept them: %s. Your choice is stored in your browser (local storage), not in a cookie set by this site. You can withdraw it at any time with the “Manage my cookies” link at the bottom of each page; the services then stop loading."
msgstr ""

#: src/Consent.php:537
msgid "Under the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA), you can access the information about you and ask for it to be corrected. You can also withdraw your consent at any time, subject to legal or contractual restrictions. Some of these services store information outside Canada."
msgstr ""

#: src/Consent.php:538
msgid "Under the GDPR, the legal basis is your consent (art. 6(1)(a)). You have the rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection and portability, and you can lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. Some of these services transfer data outside the European Union."
msgstr ""

#: src/Consent.php:539
msgid "Under the Act respecting the protection of personal information in the private sector (as amended by Law 25), you can access the information about you, have it corrected and withdraw your consent. Some of these services send information outside Quebec."
msgstr ""

#: src/Consent.php:544
msgid "Before sending personal information outside Quebec, Law 25 requires a privacy impact assessment (PIA). Name the person in charge of protecting personal information and how to reach them."
msgstr ""

